    "levels_raw": "alchemist 2, antipaladin 2, bard 2, bloodrager 2, cleric/oracle 2, paladin 2, psychic 2, shaman 2, sorcerer/wizard 2, summoner/unchained summoner 2; Bloodline imperious 2",
